  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL, xhigh effort). Read the ORIGINAL task 089's scaffolding + report skeleton + operator runbook in full; confirm Waves G-1..G-7 are ALL complete before starting (this task's &lt;deps&gt; alone do not guarantee every intermediate task landed -- verify against TASK-INDEX.md).</step>
